{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119957","id":3784929767,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7hmXHn","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119957","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119957.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119957.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119957","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119957/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119957/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119957/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0a60505eaafb87d7175b9130dd01ae7d27382c2e","number":119957,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Make script editor member overview navigate to and fold/unfold methods.","user":{"login":"SOEL86","id":4308535,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMDg1MzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4308535?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SOEL86","html_url":"https://github.com/SOEL86","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SOEL86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SOEL86/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SOEL86/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SOEL86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SOEL86/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SOEL86/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SOEL86/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SOEL86/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SOEL86/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### Issue solved\r\n\r\nClicking more than once on the member overview would do nothing after the initial 'seek' action. Now it will fold/unfold the function if the caret did not move.\r\n\r\n### Changes\r\n\r\n**script_editor_base.h**\r\n  -  get_caret_line casts the pre-existing function from code_editor->get_text_editor() without changing its shape.\r\n  - toggle_fold_line, uses existing function is_line_folded as the conditional to pick fold/unfold actions.\r\n\r\n**script_editor_plugin.cpp->_members_overview_selected**\r\n  -   If the current line equals the target line, then call the new function toggle_fold_line else call goto_line_centered as usual.\r\n\r\n### Motivation\r\n\r\nI was refactoring my code and needed to quickly move between pairs of functions. I wrote a GDScript tool to test the concept. It worked great, and was very simple to implement in C++.\r\n\r\nIt seemed a good idea to keep all the functions _members_overview_selected calls next to each other. Even though the Shader Editor doesn't have the member overview right now, the new functions should be compatible if that does become a feature.\r\n\r\n### Testing\r\n\r\nTested by opening a project with a long script and clicking the member overview list items (Windows 11).\r\n\r\n- SOEL86","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.